WEBVTT

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.930
"Secret Mission"

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:37.970
When collecting points 
at Star Rose Galaxy,

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.570
you can get a commemorative 
picture taken with RoGal's Rosy!

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:43.410
Plus we're currently holding 
a double-point campaign.

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:44.990
It's just about to start.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.290
Yeah!

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:53.750
GD Flash!

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.630
The Majestic Princes are 
Police Chiefs for a Day?!

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:57.460
Hiya! Hiya!

00:01:57.460 --> 00:02:00.640
Everyone, committing 
crimes is a big no-no!

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.060
S-sure is!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:11.600
Ahem! Anager-may, get 
me some pickled guts!

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:12.940
Really, now!

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:17.400
We're stars for the day, so we're 
allowed to be a bit demanding.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.520
Here are your pickled fish guts!

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:19.360
You had some?!

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.010
This is the stuff!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:24.700
Are you tired?

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.040
No, I just got a bit 
nervous back there...

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.200
I'm glad that's all it is.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.130
Oh, we'll be arriving at our 
next location momentarily.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.080
The Majestic Princes!!

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:36.550
The Majestic Princes!!
Are Presidents of the Hospital for 1 Day!!

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:39.970
Get all better!

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.440
Why the nurse getup?

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:49.760
The MJP are Presidents 
of a Hospital for 1 Day!

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.100
Hiya! Hiya, hiya!

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:49.080
Who wants a shot?

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.690
C'mon! Get your shot!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.900
Hey, why am I spending 
my day off like this?

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.150
Just follow me!

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:54.760
You were gonna bum the day away anyway!

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:56.140
What a thing to say!

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:58.010
I had a bunch of stuff planned out.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.610
Quit whining! Now shut up and follow me!

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:01.300
The Shopping Arcade that Floats in Space:
 STAR ROSE GALAXY

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.700
Quit pulling my arm!

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:13.380
Heroes from the Battle of Ceres,

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.180
Second Lt. Kei Kugimiya 
and Second Lt. Tamaki Irie

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:20.470
visited the hospital to comfort 
and hearten the inpatients.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:23.760
Our kittens are working 
hard, aren't they?

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:27.000
It's rather cruel of the army 
to order them to act like

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.630
stars for a day as some publicity stunt.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.680
It's because we keep losing.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.010
They have to appease the 
masses somehow, you know?

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:37.120
Isn't the world of adults a nasty place?

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.820
The Global Defense Force, GDF,

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.870
used to have no choice but to retreat

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.560
from the Wulgaru invaders.

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.700
However, since the battle 
at Undina Base, the GDF has

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.990
incorporated their new 
mobile weapons, the AHSMB,

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.500
into their battle plans.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.750
Since then, the war has dramatically 
turned in our favor.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:00.090
These five pilots belong to 
the special forces, the MJP,

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:05.720
or Military Junior Pre-Academy, 
also known as the Majestic Princes.

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:09.680
Right! I'll do my besht!

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.850
Sure will!

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:15.550
CONDENSED MILK DRINK
 Pickled Squid Guts

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:18.980
Job well done! You both did great.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:23.550
Kei, you were awesome! Even 
though you bit your tongue.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.570
What's that stuff you keep drinking?

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.900
Want one? It'll wash your fatigue away.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:33.870
It's called, "Condensed Milk DRINK".

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:41.730
Sweet! So sweet it 
nearly knocked me out!

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.000
Really?

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:45.340
Ah, that's good!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.920
Kei, do ants come after 
you in your sleep?

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.800
If you like, I also have 
brown sugar and honey!

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.350
It's even thicker!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.530
Heroes from the Battle of Ceres

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:11.750
and members of the Majestic Prince,

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.540
Second Lt. Kei Kugimiya and 
Second Lt. Tamaki Irie...

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.460
For Upset Stomach and Stomachache

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.790
Jeez, why am I stuck doing this?

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.630
Because you don't have a girlfriend!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.320
It'd suck if you wasted your day off,

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.630
so I'm letting you 
come shopping with me.

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:32.260
You should let your 
inner happiness shine!

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:46.150
Dang! I was wondering what 
you'd be interested in.

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.790
Th-this isn't what I'm 
shopping for today!

00:05:55.460 --> 00:05:57.060
Come on! We're going in!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.080
What?!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.050
Doesn't our little lady's 
expression seem forced?

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.050
Who did her makeup?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.850
Her costumes could use some help, too.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.770
You want to squeeze that in now?!

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.370
There's no way we'll get there in time!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:40.330
Huh? It'll air on every net station?

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:44.000
Very well.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.290
There has been a change 
to part of your schedule.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:47.460
What's up?

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.640
POCO, commence the auto control's 
deactivation process!

00:06:52.290 --> 00:06:55.840
Auto Control System's 
Cancel Process: Activate.

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:03.520
What?! What?! What?! What?! What?!

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.480
Wh-what?! What in the-?!

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.150
Manual Control Mode: Standby.

00:07:08.830 --> 00:07:11.070
Okay, I have control!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:13.570
You have control. Bon voyage!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.450
Thanks!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.960
Please grab on to something!

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:33.480
Ice Cream
TOFU TOFU

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:37.710
Ice Cream

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:39.640
Yay!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.150
Peko!

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.070
You'll bite your tongue if you talk.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.130
Go!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.150
This rocks!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.700
A Certain Flower Garden Preschool

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:08.090
Good afternoon!

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:14.500
PRINCIPAL

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.970
Good afternoon!

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:14.510
Hold your hands up when 
you cross the road!

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:17.020
Do it...

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:27.690
Majestic Princes are 
Principals for 1 Day!!

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:27.350
So, who is your favorite of the Princes?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:31.980
I like Gold 4's pilot, 
Second Lt. Ataru Suruga.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:35.130
His unit's primary guns are a 90 mm L/70

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.920
high-energy charged particle cannon

00:08:36.920 --> 00:08:39.590
and two 40mm L/45 radiation-guided

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:43.020
photon resonance antiaircraft 
cannons as its coax guns.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.870
He can catch any enemies in

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.960
range with a Type 99 high-depth, 3D,

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.990
inversed spectroscopic rangefinder that

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:51.240
was manufactured by Imperial 
Japan Optics Meter.

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:54.450
Then he uses the Coaxial Complex 
Topographical Reaction Control System

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.090
mounted on his entire 
unit for stabilization.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.390
No matter what the situation...

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:14.990
Star Rose Limited Edition Stickers Star 
Rose Galaxy's Official Mascot, RoGal's Rosy

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:06.850
With a new team on the battlefield 
known as the Majestic Princes,

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:09.160
the GDF decided to retaliate 
with a large-scale operation.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:11.330
This is known as the Battle of Ceres.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.120
For this operation, the GDF had every

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:16.000
space fleet from all 
of its allied nations

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.490
fight with the intent to 
demolish the enemy's forces.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.850
Unfortunately, the primary target

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.870
for this operation did not 
respond as anticipated.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.450
Our forces had no choice but to regroup.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:28.680
Regardless, the Princes 
performed magnificently,

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.700
allowing us to bring the 
Wulgaru invasion to a halt.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:34.420
We have successfully detained the 
Wulgaru in the Asteroid Belt.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.820
It's all how you look at it, huh?

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:44.030
The GDF space forces are currently 
reorganizing most of their troops.

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.510
Where next?

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:48.140
Your next shoot is at...

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.060
OTOJIMA FILMS

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:55.660
What's up with the swimsuits?!

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:57.320
And look at those designs!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.520
What do you think these girls are?!

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:01.010
N-now, now!

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:04.990
The basic concept for this commercial 
really calls for swimsuits.

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:06.950
Call it an artistic necessity...

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:10.410
Besides, this series has been 
highly popular in Europe.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:14.120
I'm certain they'll become an 
international hit this summer!

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.460
This isn't such a big deal, is it...?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.200
What do you say, Second Lt. Tamaki?

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.450
Sure, I'm game.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:21.630
And there you have it!

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.760
And what do you say?

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.390
Are you... asking me?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.260
I think it would look fabulous on you!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.610
I'm thinking, "Don't give me this crap!"

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:36.940
What IS this?

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:40.530
Trying to cover as little skin 
as possible? Is it a STRING?

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.860
And is that transparent material?

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.530
That one seems to have a 
fair amount of material,

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:48.690
but why bother when it's flesh-toned?

00:12:48.690 --> 00:12:50.630
And the print is made 
to look like real skin?

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:52.870
Someone right beside you could 
mistake you for being naked,

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.540
let alone people from a distance.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.860
Can you even air this?

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:59.080
And did you look at the materials used?

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:01.530
This is made to melt when it gets wet!

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:02.560
Isn't that nuts?!

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:04.350
What were you thinking, 
making a swimsuit

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.240
that melts when you get in the water?!

00:13:06.240 --> 00:13:09.130
Doesn't this make you want to crack 
open the head of whoever is responsible

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.730
and see if it's filled with miso?!

00:13:10.730 --> 00:13:14.110
It's said that swimsuits for women were 
thick dresses that started in the 17th Century

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:18.060
so people wouldn't see through their 
wet clothes while they played at the beach!

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.730
Then I'll do it by myself.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.690
They wore long skirts! 
So what the heck is-

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.240
After all, I think it's 
perfectly harmless.

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.740
The Shopping Arcade that Floats in Space:
 STAR ROSE GALAXY

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:39.510
Okay! On to the next shop!

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:41.680
Next? There's still more?

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.390
You know it!

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:46.340
You see, at times like 
this, girls like to...

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:54.690
Would you like one?

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.880
No way! I'm not a kid or anything.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.520
Let's go! C'mon, it's this way!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.120
FIN

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.000
We Did it!

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.000
FIN

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:28.930
Let's go on TV with her next time!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:31.430
Why don't we buy a cake 
for the little lady?

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.550
Going by the looks of 
it, she's mighty tired.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:36.480
Did you hear me? Let's 
go on TV with her!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:39.100
Come to think of it, I've 
got a friend who went on TV.

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.090
You know the rock singer, Lolo?

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:43.150
How does the Rose Eatery's 
Sachertorte sound?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.660
If I get an electric car, I want 
it to have blue faux leather!

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:47.150
I was at the music store one day when

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:48.960
someone called out to 
me and guess who it was!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.170
What should I wear on TV?

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:51.530
The spring dress I bought last week?

00:15:03.150 --> 00:15:06.130
Asagi is certainly a kind 
young lad, isn't he?

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:09.500
I'm impressed he is spending his 
day off looking after our Anna.

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:12.090
I wonder when they grew so close...

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:14.750
Hmm. A pilot for a son-in-law, eh?

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:17.460
H-hey, Dad! Don't jump to conclusions.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.350
It's too soon for that!

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:19.270
I know!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.480
Let's ask them to drop by the 
Rose Eatery on their way back.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:24.230
I haven't had a cake 
in a good long while.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:28.400
It wasn't all that long ago she 
said that she'd marry me...

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:58.800
Wow! I think this might 
be a wee bit too sexy.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:01.350
I don't think Asagi'd 
survive seeing me in this.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.310
Not so loud!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.940
Willing to risk a bloody nose?

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.860
N-no...

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.630
Well? Did it make you get tingly inside?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:18.450
My, you look great!

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.410
But considering your age,

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.570
I think this would look 
even better on you!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.700
Nah, this is fine.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:31.840
Apparently this is what she wants.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:34.210
Oh, is that right?

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:37.010
Then please come this way 
so I can ring you up.

00:16:39.090 --> 00:16:42.510
All right! All right! 
Slowly! Slowly, now!

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:43.740
Hey, who fiddled with 
the legs' circuits?

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:47.320
They're fine! I bypassed security 
and shut down everything up to 62.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.730
More importantly, I need you 
to repair the No.8 actuator.

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:50.560
Got it!

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:52.010
And let's change the pitch.

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:52.980
Sure thing!

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:54.210
There, okay!

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:54.210
That seems about right.

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:54.860
Yeah.

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:02.920
Asagi, listen... About earli-

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.960
Whoa! Why'd you suddenly stop?!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:09.340
Want one?

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.380
I already said I didn't! 
I'm not a little kid!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:15.590
No, I want one. Come join me.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.180
Welcome!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.560
Uh...

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.410
Two milk and honey-flavored 
ice cream cones!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:27.810
Coming right up!

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:29.190
Thank you.

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:33.610
Thank you for waiting.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.280
We'll be reaching the next 
spot in just a minute.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:43.200
Tamaki, you should have done 
this mission on your own...

00:17:44.650 --> 00:17:46.490
You seem to be enjoying yourself

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:48.550
and you're good at talking 
in front of people.

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:51.210
Compared to you, I...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.790
That's not true!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.630
There were plenty of things 
that weren't any fun!

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.320
Like when there weren't any hot studs

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.160
or when the costumes were ugly.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.500
But I pulled through because 
you were with me, Kei!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:03.470
Because I was there?

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:07.460
Yup! I mean, you did all 
of these gigs with me.

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:09.790
I think you're amazing the way 
you carried out this mission

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:10.900
even though "it wasn't your thing".

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:12.480
Tamaki...!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.820
Kei, you're doing your very best!

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:15.900
Knock it off, jeez!

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.540
And here we are!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:24.580
Fire Chief for 1 Day

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:40.720
I wore a bunch of different outfits!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.270
Sure did!

00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:44.220
This is the first time I've 
changed so many times in one day.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.740
That goes to show

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:48.270
how the world is filled 
with various types of jobs.

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:51.500
Does that mean I coulda done a

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.940
bunch of different jobs 
with different outfits?

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:56.320
Now, for your next outfit...

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.280
Here it is!

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.100
I'm sure it must have 
been stressful wearing

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.520
so many new and different outfits.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:04.820
But you should feel at home in-

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.030
It's only meh.

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:07.950
What?! It's a military uniform!

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:13.770
But I'm not really connecting with it...

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:16.130
Now, now, Tamaki. Let's get changed.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.820
But, but...!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:18.910
I know!

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.360
You think that there might 
be another uniform that

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:23.640
matches you better, right?

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:25.590
Yup!

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.680
I'll be there with 
you, so be a big girl.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.290
Okay!

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.610
Okay, here I go!

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:33.970
Yay!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.620
Yay...

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:43.950
You should join the GDF.

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:52.630
I'm totally beat!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.570
They've completed their mission.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.640
Yes, they both worked very hard.

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:01.550
Okay, take care.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.820
Kei, Tamaki, thanks for all 
of your hard work today!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:08.640
Job well done!

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:12.320
Should we pick up something 
to eat on the way back?

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:14.930
The Rose Eatery's main 
store is up ahead.

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:16.190
Milk and honey Sachertorte!

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.450
I want pickled innards!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.650
Really!

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:19.900
They carry that.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.170
Sweet! My pickled guts!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:27.740
Honestly, I'm sorry she took 
up your entire day off.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.940
It's fine! I had a pretty good time.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:34.070
Oh, here! It's a Sachertorte 
from the Rose Eatery.

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:35.460
It was the last one.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:36.670
Oh, thanks!

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:39.560
I'm a sucker for sweets!

00:20:37.390 --> 00:20:39.560
Come on, Anna. Wake up.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.720
Papa, I'm back.

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:44.300
Hey, Asagi!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:45.180
What is it?

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.400
Here!

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:52.180
Thanks for being so considerate 
throughout the day.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.100
Fast Acting, Gentle on Stomach
 SAIONJI STOMACH MEDICINE EX
 For Upset Stomach and Stomachache Works on Hangovers

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.520
I hear it works wonders.

